    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Midsummer Night Dreams | Les Grands Ballets Canadiens | Feb 4 - 6, 2027 | Southam Hall"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/40365/2025-12-22_gb_26-27_songe6294__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "With the NAC Orchestra\n\nWhat becomes of love over time?\n\nAn enchanted forest, themes of love, illusion and desire, mischief, intrigue, and a star hobgoblin — it’s no wonder Shakespeare’s A Midsummer Night’s Dream has enjoyed such enduring popularity. Add a gifted choreographer and a renowned ballet company to the mix, and you have a tour de force in the making.\n\nLes Grands Ballets Canadiens’ commission to choreographer Guillaume Côté to create a full-length Dream offers a deeply human reimagining of Shakespeare’s 1595 play, transposing..."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "728780803"
      }
    ],
