    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In 2par2, choreographer and major player on the Qu&eacute;bec Hip Hop dance scene Alexandra &lsquo;Spicey&rsquo; Land&eacute;&nbsp;places relationships, in all their contradictions, at the centre of her artistic explorations. Conceived as a play of dualities and polarities, the work embraces an intimate and demanding narrative that probes the transformative power of human connections"
